        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Howard Schnellenberger\n- Organizations: Miami Hurricanes football team, Nebraska Cornhuskers\n- Events: 1983 college football season, Orange Bowl\n- Roles: Head coach\n\nFacts:\n- Howard Leslie Schnellenberger was born on March 16, 1934, and he became an American football coach who worked extensively in both professional and college football.\n- In the 1983 college football season, Howard Schnellenberger served as the fifth-year head coach of the Miami Hurricanes football team.\n- In the 1983 college football season, the Miami Hurricanes finished with an 11–1 record.\n- In the Orange Bowl concluding that season, the Miami Hurricanes defeated the Nebraska Cornhuskers.",
